      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "special_communications/490100708/4901007080010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいぞ、場所変えようか？\r\n事務所とか、喫茶店とか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007080020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ\r\nすぐ終わるので、大丈夫です",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100708/4901007080020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007080030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "誰かに会っても気恥ずかしいですし……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490100708/4901007080030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ、このまま聞こう\r\nどうしたんだ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901007080040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "その、プロデューサーに\r\nクリスマスプレゼントを渡したくて……",
